{
  "base_commit": "80cf1f6189cd25610d609f44283ff9668582d759",
  "binding_rules": [
    "Base v1 stays unchanged. Import only this immutable contracts tar against fixed base; do not import changing W01 worktree.",
    "Command contains request_id and both expected business/workspace versions; payload uses contracts/v2/requests.py. executor is server-owned.",
    "kind test_set maps to test_plan via legacy.normalize_legacy_product; exact raw source retained, pending operations never executed.",
    "Four family inputs are separate types; old G1 remains LegacyAnnotation, not new double-human G1.",
    "W02 registers deterministic scenario policies through W01 public transaction layer; W03 uses ObjectWrite/Mutation plans; these storage/API implementations are not included or frozen in this draft.",
    "W09 snapshot/restore is internal and not a learner tool; interface implementation still under W01 test.",
    "No API/model/product QA or W01 completion implied by this draft."
  ],
  "changes_after_draft": "Only publish a new draft/revision; coordinate changed fields/affected consumers through031; never rewrite this draft.",
